      "content": "Can PANDA build a single TF-to-gene regulatory network for our whole cohort of 48 mouse liver RNA-seq samples? I have the gene-by-sample expression matrix, a JASPAR-based motif prior and a mouse TF-TF PPI from STRING, all using the same gene symbols."
